### Create Account
POST http://localhost:8080/create-account HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "prof@learning.com",
  "password": "helloworld15!",
  "roles": ["PROFESSOR"]
}

### Authenticate

POST  http://localhost:8080/authenticate HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "prof@learning.com",
  "password": "helloworld15!"
}

### Create user
POST http://localhost:8080/cosmic-learning/user HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "firstName": "Professor1",
  "lastName": "last name",
  "age": 24,
  "title": "Dr",
  "university" : "Harvard",
  "amount": 0,
  "appUserId" : 4
}

### Get questions by professor id
GET {{url}}/by-professor/1 HTTP/1.1

### Get questions by subject id
GET {{url}}/by-subject/2 HTTP/1.1

### Create Question
POST {{url}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "questionId": 1,
  "question": "What fell on newton's head",
  "hint": "gravity",
  "professor": {
    "userId": 4
  },
  "subject" : {
    "subjectId": 1
  }
}

### update question
PUT {{url}}/10 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "questionId": 10,
  "question": "updated",
  "hint": "gravity",
  "professor": {
    "userId": 4
  },
  "subject" : {
    "subjectId": 1
  }
}

